[6.480, "o", "🤖 Welcome to your first DevFest! Here are 3 sessions tailored to your interests in ML and Flutter:\r\n\r\n1. **The Google Cloud Stack for Production AI Agents**  \r\n   • **Speaker:** Omar Elcircevi  \r\n   • **Day:** Saturday, 2026-10-24  \r\n   • **Time:** 10:30  \r\n   • **Floor:** Kat 1  \r\n\r\n2. **From Model to Cluster: Large-Scale AI/ML Workloads on GKE**  \r\n   • **Speaker:** Enes Turan  \r\n   • **Day:** Sunday, 2026-10-25  \r\n   • **Time:** 10:30  \r\n   • **Floor:** Kat 1  \r\n\r\n3. **Bağlantıyı Kurmak: Modern Flutter & Firebase Sistemleri**  \r\n   • **Speaker:** Kadriye Macit  \r\n   • **Day:** Sunday, 2026-10-25  \r\n   • **Time:** 14:15  \r\n   • **Floor:** Kat 2  \r\n\r\nHave a fantastic time at the conference! Let me know if you need anything else.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m⏳ Memory Bank is extracting facts in the background...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
