[3.175, "o", "🤖 Based on your interest in Machine Learning and Flutter, here are 3 great sessions for tomorrow (Sunday, Oct 25, 2026):\r\n\r\n1. **From Model to Cluster: Large-Scale AI/ML Workloads on GKE**\r\n   - **Speaker:** Enes Turan\r\n   - **Day:** Sunday (2026-10-25)\r\n   - **Time:** 10:30\r\n   - **Floor:** Kat 1\r\n\r\n2. **Bağlantıyı Kurmak: Modern Flutter & Firebase Sistemleri**\r\n   - **Speaker:** Kadriye Macit\r\n   - **Day:** Sunday (2026-10-25)\r\n   - **Time:** 14:15\r\n   - **Floor:** Kat 2\r\n\r\n3. **No GPU Left Behind: Hybrid Ultralytics YOLO Training and Fast Execution**\r\n   - **Speaker:** Onuralp Sezer\r\n   - **Day:** Sunday (2026-10-25)\r\n   - **Time:** 15:30\r\n   - **Floor:** Kat 1\r\n\r\nEnjoy your day at DevFest!\r\n\r\n"]
